## Power, run time, charge time

{md_tbl(["Mode", "mA from the cell", "Time"], [(m, str(ma), t) for m, ma, _s, t in POWER])}

Carried over unchanged from the first two builds: the cell is the only source and nothing feeds
the `5V` pin; the amp is off until firmware raises SD, cap 65, GAIN open; neither speaker lead
is ground; the brass is not a conductor (meter frame-to-every-net before the cell goes in);
never solder to or cold-charge the cell.

## Frame cut list

{md_tbl(["Piece", "Stock", "Length", "How"], CUTS)}

Bending: one turn of 1.5 mm rod around a 66 mm drink can (springs back to about 70 mm), lap the
ends 8 mm, solder, file round, hide the joint under the base ring. Base ring around a 42 mm jar.

